                "text_color": "text",
                "custom_text_color": "#ff0000",
                "title": "Sestavina brez količine",
                "icon_heading_size": "h3",
                "text": "<p>Na embalaži piše glukozamin, hondroitin, kurkuma. Številke nikjer. Nimaš s čim primerjati, torej tudi ne moreš izbrati.</p>",
                "text_size": 14,
                "margin_top": 15,
                "margin_bottom": 15
              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
            "icon_with_content_UeGAXV": {
              "type": "icon-with-content",
              "name": "Icon with content",
              "settings": {
                "visibility": "always-display",
                "icon": "check_circle",
                "filled_icon": true,
                "icon_size": "m",
                "icon_position": "next-to-title",
                "icon_color": "accent-1",
                "custom_icon_color": "#ff0000",
                "icon_text_alignment": "left",
                "text_color": "text",
                "custom_text_color": "#ff0000",
                "title": "Toliko, da so smeli napisati",
                "icon_heading_size": "h3",
                "text": "<p>Sestavina je res notri — v količini, ki zadošča, da se sme pojaviti na seznamu. Nič več. Nisem kupovala slabih izdelkov, kupovala sem prazne.</p>",
                "text_size": 14,
                "margin_top": 15,
                "margin_bottom": 15
              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
            "icon_with_content_VTgKCh": {
              "type": "icon-with-content",
              "name": "Icon with content",
              "settings": {
                "visibility": "always-display",
                "icon": "check_circle",
                "filled_icon": true,
                "icon_size": "m",
                "icon_position": "next-to-title",
                "icon_color": "accent-1",
                "custom_icon_color": "#ff0000",
                "icon_text_alignment": "left",
                "text_color": "text",
                "custom_text_color": "#ff0000",
                "title": "Ena sama sestavina",
                "icon_heading_size": "h3",
                "text": "<p>Večina lončkov pokrije eno stvar. Pri starejšem psu se jih dogaja več hkrati, zato en sam pristop preprosto ne zajame vsega.</p>",
                "text_size": 14,
                "margin_top": 15,
                "margin_bottom": 15
              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
            "icon_with_content_6mYKXU": {
              "type": "icon-with-content",
              "name": "Icon with content",
              "settings": {
                "visibility": "always-display",
                "icon": "check_circle",
                "filled_icon": true,
                "icon_size": "m",
                "icon_position": "next-to-title",
                "icon_color": "accent-1",
                "custom_icon_color": "#ff0000",
                "icon_text_alignment": "left",
                "text_color": "text",
                "custom_text_color": "#ff0000",
                "title": "Isti odmerek za vsakega psa",
                "icon_heading_size": "h3",
                "text": "<p>Pri vseh sedmih je pisalo eno in isto za vse pse. Ni logično, da bi pes s 30 kilogrami dobil enako kot pes s petimi.</p>",
                "text_size": 14,
                "margin_top": 15,
                "margin_bottom": 15
              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
            "icon_with_content_y78XBy": {
              "type": "icon-with-content",
              "name": "Icon with content",
